        "heading": "<p>More Powerful in the Canister. More <strong>Bioavailable in the Body</strong>.</p>",
        "subtext": "<p>Antioxidant testing has two parts that most brands ignore. First, how much antioxidant power is in the canister (in vitro). Second, how much of that actually reaches your bloodstream (in vivo). We tested both. Testing was performed independently by Kerry Ringer, PhD (Plant Biochemistry) and Mark Saverese (Chemical Engineer) of Columbia Phytotechnology.</p>",
